    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A randomly generated hexagonal map at the start of each game ensures a completely unique challenge every time.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208260/extras/5fe3f805a2359f1cde693b88852784c4.poster.avif?t=1745388022\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208260/extras/5fe3f805a2359f1cde693b88852784c4.webm?t=1745388022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208260/extras/5fe3f805a2359f1cde693b88852784c4.mp4?t=1745388022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your own building card deck and execute brilliant construction strategies on the map.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208260/extras/827030f5ba5c952ed86577987db46fb6.poster.avif?t=1745388022\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208260/extras/827030f5ba5c952ed86577987db46fb6.webm?t=1745388022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208260/extras/827030f5ba5c952ed86577987db46fb6.mp4?t=1745388022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Freely combine motorcycle components to enhance your delivery capabilities.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208260/extras/eca7ca2c1a0bcdb80f49cf9376dc7980.poster.avif?t=1745388022\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208260/extras/eca7ca2c1a0bcdb80f49cf9376dc7980.webm?t=1745388022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208260/extras/eca7ca2c1a0bcdb80f49cf9376dc7980.mp4?t=1745388022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine cards, components, and terrain to tackle the biggest challenges.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208260/extras/ab27fdb5525078f7f61c358e68eac67f.poster.avif?t=1745388022\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208260/extras/ab27fdb5525078f7f61c358e68eac67f.webm?t=1745388022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208260/extras/ab27fdb5525078f7f61c358e68eac67f.mp4?t=1745388022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A randomly generated hexagonal map at the start of each game ensures a completely unique challenge every time.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208260/extras/5fe3f805a2359f1cde693b88852784c4.poster.avif?t=1745388022\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208260/extras/5fe3f805a2359f1cde693b88852784c4.webm?t=1745388022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208260/extras/5fe3f805a2359f1cde693b88852784c4.mp4?t=1745388022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your own building card deck and execute brilliant construction strategies on the map.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208260/extras/827030f5ba5c952ed86577987db46fb6.poster.avif?t=1745388022\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208260/extras/827030f5ba5c952ed86577987db46fb6.webm?t=1745388022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208260/extras/827030f5ba5c952ed86577987db46fb6.mp4?t=1745388022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Freely combine motorcycle components to enhance your delivery capabilities.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208260/extras/eca7ca2c1a0bcdb80f49cf9376dc7980.poster.avif?t=1745388022\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208260/extras/eca7ca2c1a0bcdb80f49cf9376dc7980.webm?t=1745388022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208260/extras/eca7ca2c1a0bcdb80f49cf9376dc7980.mp4?t=1745388022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine cards, components, and terrain to tackle the biggest challenges.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208260/extras/ab27fdb5525078f7f61c358e68eac67f.poster.avif?t=1745388022\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208260/extras/ab27fdb5525078f7f61c358e68eac67f.webm?t=1745388022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208260/extras/ab27fdb5525078f7f61c358e68eac67f.mp4?t=1745388022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
